Title: Broadband & Telecommunications | Colliers Engineering & Design
Content: ## Broadband & Telecommunications

Colliers Engineering & Design provides end-to-end engineering services for broadband and fiber optic network deployment. Our multidisciplinary team delivers solutions from initial network planning through design, permitting, and construction management.

**Services Include:**
- Fiber optic network design and engineering
- GIS mapping and spatial analysis
- Permit application preparation and coordination
- Make-ready engineering for aerial and underground installations
- Construction management and inspection
- BEAD program support and grant administration assistance

**Our Approach**
Our telecommunications team integrates GIS data with CAD-based engineering workflows to produce construction-ready drawings and permit packages. We work with ISPs, municipalities, and utilities to streamline the path from network design to deployment.

**Tools and Technology**
Our team leverages industry-leading platforms including Esri ArcGIS, AutoCAD, MicroStation, and network design tools such as Katapult Pro and IQGeo to deliver accurate, construction-ready documentation.

**BEAD Readiness**
Colliers Engineering & Design is positioned to support clients navigating BEAD funding requirements, providing the engineering documentation and GIS deliverables required for state program compliance.

